            { "id": "CWE-89", "name": "SQL Injection" },
            { "id": "CWE-223", "name": "Omission of Security-relevant Information" },
            { "id": "CWE-287", "name": "Improper Authentication" },
            { "id": "CWE-345", "name": "Insufficient Verification of Data Authenticity" },
            { "id": "CWE-918", "name": "Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "results": [
        {
          "_comment": "Example 1: Threat with a control found, assessed in this run. security-severity reflects the RESIDUAL score (inherent * (1 - reduction_factor)), not the inherent score. The level is mapped from the RESIDUAL severity band: Critical and High are error, Medium is warning, Low is note. message.text ends with the control status in brackets, and message.markdown is the finding's mitigation text from the threat model, as in risk-scores.sarif, or the empty string when the finding has none. relatedLocations holds control evidence only, one entry for each evidence item, and no entry names a finding. control-evidence repeats the same evidence as file, line and snippet (line is an integer), and a found finding has an empty recommendation and effort-estimate. integrity-flags is always present, and holds sorted kind:field:cause strings.",
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/spoofing",
          "message": {
            "text": "<threat-description-from-source-finding> [Control: found]",
            "markdown": "<mitigation-recommendation-from-source-finding>"
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "<repo-relative-architecture-file-path>"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "<component-name-from-finding>",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "<trust-zone>/<component-name>",
                  "kind": "process"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "relatedLocations": [
            {
              "id": 0,
              "message": {
                "text": "Control evidence: <control-category> detected in <file-path>"
              },
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "<control-evidence-file-path>"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 42
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 1,
              "message": {
                "text": "Control evidence: <control-category> detected in <file-path>"
              },
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "<control-evidence-file-path-2>"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 17
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "primaryLocationLineHash": "<tachi-plh/1-hash-16-hex-digits-then-:1>",
            "findingId/v1": "S-1"
          },
          "properties": {
            "security-severity": "<residual-score-as-numeric-string>",
            "control-status": "found",
            "control-evidence": [
              {
                "file": "<control-evidence-file-path>",
                "line": 42,
                "snippet": "<code-snippet-up-to-5-lines>"
              },
              {
                "file": "<control-evidence-file-path-2>",
                "line": 17,
                "snippet": "<code-snippet-2>"
              }
            ],
            "control-carry-forward": false,
            "control-effectiveness": "strong",
            "inherent-risk": "<original-composite-score-from-risk-scores>",
            "residual-risk": "<calculated-residual-score>",
            "maestro-layer": "<maestro-layer-name-or-Unclassified>",
            "recommendation": "",
            "effort-estimate": "",
            "integrity-flags": []
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "Example 2: Threat with a partial control: the residual score is partially reduced. recommendation is the What to Implement text of the finding's Section 4 block, which for a partial control focuses on hardening the existing control (what is missing, how to extend), and effort-estimate is that block's Effort word (Low, Medium or High). relatedLocations holds the evidence of the partial control. integrity-flags shows one flag here, for a prose field that was cut at its length limit.",
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/tampering",
          "message": {
            "text": "<threat-description-from-source-finding> [Control: partial]",
            "markdown": "<mitigation-recommendation-from-source-finding>"
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "<repo-relative-architecture-file-path>"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "<component-name-from-finding>",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "<trust-zone>/<component-name>",
                  "kind": "process"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "relatedLocations": [
            {
              "id": 0,
              "message": {
                "text": "Control evidence: <control-category> detected in <file-path>"
              },
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "<control-evidence-file-path>"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 42
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "primaryLocationLineHash": "<tachi-plh/1-hash-16-hex-digits-then-:1>",
            "findingId/v1": "T-2"
          },
          "properties": {
            "security-severity": "<residual-score-as-numeric-string>",
            "control-status": "partial",
            "control-evidence": [
              {
                "file": "<control-evidence-file-path>",
                "line": 42,
                "snippet": "<code-snippet-showing-partial-control>"
              }
            ],
            "control-carry-forward": false,
            "control-effectiveness": "moderate",
            "inherent-risk": "<original-composite-score-from-risk-scores>",
            "residual-risk": "<calculated-residual-score>",
            "maestro-layer": "<maestro-layer-name-or-Unclassified>",
            "recommendation": "<what-to-implement-text-of-the-section-4-block>",
            "effort-estimate": "Medium",
            "integrity-flags": ["input:evidence.summary:truncated"]
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "Example 3: Threat with no control found: the residual score equals the inherent score (no reduction), and the level is mapped from that band. relatedLocations is omitted, because a missing finding has no evidence to link, and control-evidence is an empty array. recommendation is the What to Implement text of the finding's Section 4 block, which for a missing control gives full implementation guidance, and effort-estimate is that block's Effort word.",
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/denial-of-service",
          "message": {
            "text": "<threat-description-from-source-finding> [Control: missing]",
            "markdown": "<mitigation-recommendation-from-source-finding>"
          },
          "level": "error",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "<repo-relative-architecture-file-path>"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "<component-name-from-finding>",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "<trust-zone>/<component-name>",
                  "kind": "process"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "primaryLocationLineHash": "<tachi-plh/1-hash-16-hex-digits-then-:1>",
            "findingId/v1": "D-1"
          },
          "properties": {
            "security-severity": "<residual-score-equals-inherent-score-as-numeric-string>",
            "control-status": "missing",
            "control-evidence": [],
            "control-carry-forward": false,
            "control-effectiveness": "none",
            "inherent-risk": "<original-composite-score-from-risk-scores>",
            "residual-risk": "<same-as-inherent-no-reduction>",
            "maestro-layer": "<maestro-layer-name-or-Unclassified>",
            "recommendation": "<what-to-implement-text-of-the-section-4-block>",
            "effort-estimate": "High",
            "integrity-flags": []
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "Example 4: AI agentic threat with a control found, carried forward from the baseline (an UNCHANGED finding): control-carry-forward is true, and the finding's row in Section 2 shows CF. The rule is an AI-category rule, whose relationships name a CWE target only. The carried status, evidence and recommendation come from the baseline's persisted inputs, and the renderer recomputes the residual score from this run's inherent score. P0: control-effectiveness is derived from control-status (found is strong, partial is moderate, missing is none).",
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/agentic-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "<threat-description-from-source-finding> [Control: found]",
            "markdown": "<mitigation-recommendation-from-source-finding>"
          },
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "<repo-relative-architecture-file-path>"
                },
                "region": {
